
### GET - All books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

###

### POST - Add a book
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "title": "C++",
  "price": 350
}

###

### PUT - Update book 2
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Python",
  "price": 500
}

###

### DELETE - Delete book 2
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/2
